  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eggs Breaking &amp; Pasteurization Factory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frisian Egg and its local partner in Pakistan will jointly invest in a liquid egg production facility in Karachi.DGGF and a Pakistani bank intend to finance the project. 50 jobs will be created in the facility. Besides the direct jobs, the project provides a significant impact on the employment in local companies in the supply chain. The company has a local purchasing and sales policy in Pakistan. The egg suppliers will be trained to produce better quality eggs under better conditions for the chicken.</narrative>
  </description>
